@baseUrl = https://localhost:7001
@householdId = 00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000001
@receiptId = 00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000002
@accessToken = paste-access-token-here

### Subir ticket o factura (JPEG, PNG o PDF)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/households/{{householdId}}/receipts
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=ReceiptBoundary

--ReceiptBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="file"; filename="ticket.jpg"
Content-Type: image/jpeg

< ./ticket.jpg
--ReceiptBoundary--

### Consultar el resultado OCR más reciente
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/households/{{householdId}}/receipts/{{receiptId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
